{"t":"Infernal Bolt","s":"infernal-bolt-35fe1","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Infernal_Bolt_6b7307.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Infernal Bolt</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Infernal Bolt\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Infernal_Bolt_6b7307.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">110</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"attack\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attack</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">72</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hit_chance\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><abbr title=\"Maximum hit chance before any bow/crossbow hit chance modifier.\">Max Hit Chance</abbr></h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">90%</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapons<br/>Ammunition</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.90 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9 - 20 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.9<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20090704070449&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Infernal_Bolt_6b7307.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an infernal bolt.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 110 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.90 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Infernal Bolts have the 2nd highest attack of all ammunition available for crossbows in the game (only beaten by Spectral Bolts).<br/>\nThese bolts are not available from NPC stores, thus their price depends on the game world economy. The easiest way to get them is by asking an experienced blacksmith to craft 3 bolts from a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Orb\">Soul Orb</a>.\n</p><p>Historically, these bolts were seldom used due to sparsity of the material. Nowadays, on older servers there is an abundance of soul orbs coming from places like <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul%20Prison\">Roshamuul Prison</a> being a popular hunting destination among higher-level characters. If obtained in large quantities at NPC buyback price of 25 gp, an infernal bolt effectively costs as low as 8.5 gp each. \nSuch a price tag places them cheaper than weaker Prismatic and Drill Bolts, thus making them a very affordable ammunition in terms of cost per damage, beating Crystalline Arrows by a factor of ~2.5.\n</p><p>You can <b>exchange</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Orb\">Soul Orbs</a> for Infernal Bolts through the The Sweaty Cyclops Quest. Each orb turns into 3 infernal bolts.<br/>\nYou can <b>obtain</b> 100 Infernal Bolts in The Ultimate Challenges Quest Warlord Level.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">Summer Update 2012</a>, the attack and level requirement were changed from 42 to 72 and level 70 to 110.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morgaroth\">Morgaroth</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Sweaty%20Cyclops\">A Sweaty Cyclops</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Orb\">Soul Orb</a></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">By saying <i>soul orb</i>. Three (90%) or six (10%) infernal bolts are obtained by delivering each soul orb.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Sweaty%20Cyclops\">A Sweaty Cyclops</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Abyssador\">Abyssador</a></li><li>Ammunition</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a></li><li>Archdemons</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Star\">Assassin Star</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-arena-quest\">Barbarian Arena Quest</a></li><li>Bosses</li><li>Contest Prizes</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a></li><li>Crossbow Ammunition</li><li>Crystalline Arrow</li><li>Distance Weapons</li><li>Dreamhaunters</li><li>Drill Bolt</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li><li>Guide:Playing a Paladin</li><li>Infernal Bolt Missile</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morgaroth\">Morgaroth</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">Power Bolt</a></li><li>Prismatic Bolt</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Crossbow\">Royal Crossbow</a></li><li>Scam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Orb\">Soul Orb</a></li><li>Spectral Bolt</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Terofar\">Terofar</a